# A chunky hand-knit scarf in red and gold stripes, wrapped round the neck with a fringed tail
# down the chest. knit-scarf-flutter-0/-1: the tail streams back and up over the shoulders in the
# wind (two phases of the wave).
name: knit-scarf
size: 25x17
anchor: neck 20 8
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  M #e74c3c
  D #c0392b
  Y #f7dc6f
  y #d4ac3a

